2013-03-19  Joost van Baal-Ilić <joostvb@uvt.nl>

	* caspar/mk/caspar.mk: Swap dealing with $(csp_TABOOFILES) and
	$(csp_BUILD) in contructing FILES to be install-ed.  Now
	$(csp_TABOOFILES) is subtracted from $(csp_BUILD) (was: $(csp_BUILD)
	gets added to result of subtracting $(csp_TABOOFILES) from list of
	FILES.  So, now "csp_BUILD = check" and "csp_TABOOFILES_ADD = check"
	no longer results in caspar trying to install a file called 'check'.

